214
00:12:13,214 --> 00:12:13,925
No.

215
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:17,220
Why not? We're already through
the looking glass anyway.

216
00:12:22,094 --> 00:12:23,689
Okay, so here's the thing...

217
00:12:24,537 --> 00:12:27,148
